URL:https://artsatthearmory.org/events/lovestruck-books-presents-grim-tidi
 ngs-release-day-bash-with-b-k-borison/
SUMMARY:Lovestruck Books Presents: Grim Tidings Release-Day Bash with B.K. 
 Borison
DESCRIPTION:A new whimsical\, haunting romance. When a runaway Grim Reaper 
 tries to save a life\, she forms an unlikely partnership with a Guardian A
 ngel.\nGet tickets now!\n\n\n  $('#getTixButton').click(function() {\n    
 fbq('track'\, 'Purchase'\, {currency: "USD"\, value: 0.00})\;\n  })\;\n\n\
 nCelebrate release day with New York Times bestselling author B.K. Bori
 son as we gather at Arts at the Armory in Somerville for a special conv
 ersation about Grim Tidings.\n\nIn conversation with New York Times bes
 tselling author\, Ashley Poston\, B.K. will discuss her enchanting new r
 omance that blends magic\, mischief\, and irresistible chemistry.\n\nWhen 
 runaway Grim Reaper Darcy Moore decides to save a life instead of claiming
  it\, she finds herself at odds with Guardian Angel Gabriel Aetos\, a stub
 born protector with plenty of reasons not to trust her. As sparks fly betw
 een these unlikely rivals and the Department of Hauntings &amp\; Spirits c
 loses in\, Darcy and Gabriel must navigate fate\, second chances\, and fee
 lings that refuse to stay buried.\n\nJoin us for an evening of behind-the-
 scenes stories\, author insights\, and all the swoony\, spooky fun of Bori
 son’s latest enemies-to-lovers romance\, followed by a meet and greet in
  celebration of the release.\n\n\nArts at the Armory serves delicious loca
 lly sourced food and drink at the Performance Hall bar when doors open (us
 ually one hour before the show). Please arrive early to enjoy dinner and d
 rinks before the event. The full menu can be viewed HERE. Check out Park
 ing/Directions and FAQs for more information about our venue.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://artsatthearmory.org/wp-content/uploads/2
 026/08/b-k-borison-grim-tidings.webp
CATEGORIES:Literary Art,Performance Hall
END:VEVENT
