URL:https://artsatthearmory.org/events/nothing-but-the-truth/
SUMMARY:Nothing But The Truth
DESCRIPTION:We’re putting our fellow comedians on trial in this 1hr\, all
  improv comedy show!\nGet tickets now!\n\n\n  $('#getTixButton').click(fun
 ction() {\n    fbq('track'\, 'Purchase'\, {currency: "USD"\, value: 0.00})
 \;\n  })\;\n\n\nHave you ever wanted to go back to high school civics clas
 s? "Nothing But The Truth" is an all-improv mock trial brought to you by s
 ome of Boston's most litigious comedians. You'll see two sides of the same
  story\, then vote on which story seems closest to the truth - and which g
 roup of comics is going straight to jail.\n\nHosted by Alice Weis and Sav 
 Shelton\, Nothing but the Truth is a 90 minute improv spectacular based on
  the storied tradition of the American mock trial.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://artsatthearmory.org/wp-content/uploads/2
 026/07/nothing-but-the-truth.webp
CATEGORIES:Cafe,Comedy
END:VEVENT
